---
import { GITHUB_URL, DOCS_URL } from "../consts";
const year = 2026;
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<footer>
  <div class="wrap foot">
    <div class="foot-brand">
      <img
        src={`${base}korkut-logo.svg`}
        alt="Korkut logosu"
        width="28"
        height="28"
      />
      <span>Korkut</span>
    </div>

    <p class="muted tagline">
      Hukuk büroları için, veriyi ofiste tutan açık kaynak yapay zeka asistanı.
    </p>

    <nav class="foot-links" aria-label="Alt menü">
      <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <a href={DOCS_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dokümantasyon</a>
      <a href={`${GITHUB_URL}/blob/main/LICENSE`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">MIT Lisansı</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap foot-bottom">
    <span class="muted">© {year} Korkut · Recep Kızılarslan</span>
    <span class="muted"
      >Hukuki tavsiye değildir. “OLDUĞU GİBİ”, garanti verilmeksizin sunulur.</span
    >
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 44px 0 32px;
  }
  .foot {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .foot-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 17px;
  }
  .foot-brand img {
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 2px;
  }
  .tagline {
    flex: 1 1 260px;
    min-width: 200px;
  }
  .foot-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .foot-links a {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .foot-links a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .muted {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .foot-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
</style>
